Description: GNOME-based system for touch devices (metapackage)
 VibeOS turns GNOME into a system for touch devices, phones first, then
 tablets and touch laptops: the VibeOS launcher as the home screen,
 Android-style gesture navigation, recents, the status bar, the notification
 shade with quick settings, the lock screen and the always-on display, and a
 set of apps.
 .
 This metapackage installs the shell extension, the launcher and the system
 helpers, and recommends the session and the apps.

